<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login Error</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar">
    <a href="/" class="logo">&#129302; Bot Dashboard</a>
  </div>
  <div class="main" style="max-width:600px;margin:4rem auto;text-align:center;">
    <div class="card" style="padding:3rem;">
      <div style="font-size:4rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">&#128683;</div>
      <h1 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Login Failed</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><%= message %></p>

      <div class="card" style="background:var(--bg);text-align:left;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">&#128221; To fix this, make sure:</h2>
        <ol style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text2);padding-left:1.2rem;line-height:2;">
          <li>Go to <a href="https://discord.com/developers/applications" target="_blank">Discord Developer Portal</a></li>
          <li>Select your application</li>
          <li>Go to <strong>OAuth2</strong> section</li>
          <li>Under <strong>Redirects</strong>, add:<br>
            <code style="background:var(--bg3);padding:0.3rem 0.6rem;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;margin-top:0.3rem;">http://localhost:3000/auth/callback</code>
          </li>
          <li>Click <strong>Save Changes</strong></li>
          <li>Make sure <strong>Client ID</strong> and <strong>Client Secret</strong> in <code>.env</code> are correct</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;justify-content:center;">
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary">&#128260; Try Again</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">&#127968; Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
